      "text": "The act by which a person is born again. Baptism is called the “washing of regeneration” (Titus 3:5), because through it one’s sins are washed away and one becomes renewed through the Holy Spirit. See also Matt. 19:28; John 1:13; 3:3–5; Eph. 4:22–24; 1 Pet. 1:3.",
